{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 17,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 261.427,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the days of Ahaz the son of Jotham, the son of Uzziah, king of Judah",
      "verse": "17:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 6.914,
      "end": 8.957,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that Rezin, king of Syria,",
      "verse": "17:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.137,
      "end": 16.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Pekah the son of Remaliah, king of Israel, went up toward Jerusalem to war against it,",
      "verse": "17:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 16.422,
      "end": 18.698,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but could not prevail against it.",
      "verse": "17:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 19.378,
      "end": 21.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it was told the house of David, saying:",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 21.88,
      "end": 24.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Syria is confederate with Ephraim.",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.382,
      "end": 25.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And his heart was moved,",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 26.141,
      "end": 28.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the heart of his people,",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.318,
      "end": 31.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as the trees of the wood are moved with the wind.",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 32.342,
      "end": 34.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then said the Lord unto Isaiah:",
      "verse": "17:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 34.658,
      "end": 36.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Go forth now to meet Ahaz,",
      "verse": "17:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 36.742,
      "end": 44.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou and Shearjashub thy son, at the end of the conduit of the upper pool in the highway of the fuller's field;",
      "verse": "17:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 44.992,
      "end": 46.617,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And say unto him:",
      "verse": "17:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 46.797,
      "end": 48.515,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Take heed, and be quiet;",
      "verse": "17:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 48.695,
      "end": 49.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "fear not,",
      "verse": "17:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 50.129,
      "end": 54.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither be faint-hearted for the two tails of these smoking firebrands,",
      "verse": "17:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 54.86,
      "end": 58.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the fierce anger of Rezin with Syria,",
      "verse": "17:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 58.244,
      "end": 60.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and of the son of Remaliah.",
      "verse": "17:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 60.874,
      "end": 66.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Because Syria, Ephraim, and the son of Remaliah, have taken evil counsel against thee, saying:",
      "verse": "17:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 67.405,
      "end": 70.006,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Let us go up against Judah and vex it,",
      "verse": "17:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 70.186,
      "end": 72.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and let us make a breach therein for us,",
      "verse": "17:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 72.827,
      "end": 75.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and set a king in the midst of it,",
      "verse": "17:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 75.608,
      "end": 77.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the son of Tabeal.",
      "verse": "17:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 77.867,
      "end": 79.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus saith the Lord God:",
      "verse": "17:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 79.951,
      "end": 81.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "It shall not stand,",
      "verse": "17:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 81.803,
      "end": 83.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall it come to pass.",
      "verse": "17:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 84.387,
      "end": 86.848,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the head of Syria is Damascus,",
      "verse": "17:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 87.028,
      "end": 89.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the head of Damascus, Rezin;",
      "verse": "17:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 89.298,
      "end": 91.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and within threescore and five years",
      "verse": "17:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 91.707,
      "end": 94.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall Ephraim be broken that it be not a people.",
      "verse": "17:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 95.452,
      "end": 97.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the head of Ephraim is Samaria,",
      "verse": "17:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 98.093,
      "end": 100.601,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the head of Samaria is Remaliah's son.",
      "verse": "17:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 100.781,
      "end": 104.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If ye will not believe surely ye shall not be established.",
      "verse": "17:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 104.758,
      "end": 108.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Moreover, the Lord spake again unto Ahaz, saying:",
      "verse": "17:10",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 109.339,
      "end": 111.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ask thee a sign of the Lord thy God;",
      "verse": "17:11",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 111.98,
      "end": 114.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ask it either in the depths,",
      "verse": "17:11",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 114.203,
      "end": 116.107,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or in the heights above.",
      "verse": "17:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 116.787,
      "end": 118.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Ahaz said:",
      "verse": "17:12",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 118.685,
      "end": 120.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will not ask,",
      "verse": "17:12",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 120.351,
      "end": 122.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither will I tempt the Lord.",
      "verse": "17:12",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 122.981,
      "end": 124.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "17:13",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 124.461,
      "end": 126.783,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Hear ye now, O house of David;",
      "verse": "17:13",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 126.963,
      "end": 129.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is it a small thing for you to weary men,",
      "verse": "17:13",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 129.929,
      "end": 132.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but will ye weary my God also?",
      "verse": "17:13",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 132.745,
      "end": 135.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, the Lord himself shall give you a sign\u2014",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 135.897,
      "end": 138.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, a virgin shall conceive,",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 138.26,
      "end": 139.978,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall bear a son,",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 140.158,
      "end": 142.294,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall call his name Immanuel.",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 142.974,
      "end": 145.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Butter and honey shall he eat,",
      "verse": "17:15",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 145.43,
      "end": 149.006,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may know to refuse the evil and to choose the good.",
      "verse": "17:15",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 149.686,
      "end": 155.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For before the child shall know to refuse the evil and choose the good,",
      "verse": "17:16",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 155.207,
      "end": 159.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the land that thou abhorrest shall be forsaken of both her kings.",
      "verse": "17:16",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 160.113,
      "end": 162.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The Lord shall bring upon thee,",
      "verse": "17:17",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 162.29,
      "end": 163.869,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon thy people,",
      "verse": "17:17",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 164.049,
      "end": 166.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon thy father's house,",
      "verse": "17:17",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 166.226,
      "end": 170.731,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "days that have not come from the day that Ephraim departed from Judah,",
      "verse": "17:17",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 170.911,
      "end": 172.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the king of Assyria.",
      "verse": "17:17",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 173.449,
      "end": 175.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass in that day",
      "verse": "17:18",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 175.951,
      "end": 177.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord shall hiss",
      "verse": "17:18",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 177.756,
      "end": 181.193,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the fly that is in the uttermost part of Egypt,",
      "verse": "17:18",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 181.373,
      "end": 184.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for the bee that is in the land of Assyria.",
      "verse": "17:18",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 184.979,
      "end": 186.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they shall come,",
      "verse": "17:19",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 186.645,
      "end": 190.035,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall rest all of them in the desolate valleys,",
      "verse": "17:19",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 190.215,
      "end": 192.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the holes of the rocks,",
      "verse": "17:19",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 192.578,
      "end": 194.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon all thorns,",
      "verse": "17:19",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 194.198,
      "end": 195.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon all bushes.",
      "verse": "17:19",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 196.643,
      "end": 203.655,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "In the same day shall the Lord shave with a razor that is hired, by them beyond the river, by the king of Assyria,",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 203.835,
      "end": 206.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the head, and the hair of the feet;",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 206.801,
      "end": 209.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it shall also consume the beard.",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 209.896,
      "end": 212.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass in that day,",
      "verse": "17:21",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 212.537,
      "end": 215.602,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a man shall nourish a young cow and two sheep;",
      "verse": "17:21",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 216.282,
      "end": 220.74,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass, for the abundance of milk they shall give",
      "verse": "17:22",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 220.92,
      "end": 222.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he shall eat butter;",
      "verse": "17:22",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 222.725,
      "end": 227.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for butter and honey shall every one eat that is left in the land.",
      "verse": "17:22",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 228.188,
      "end": 230.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass in that day,",
      "verse": "17:23",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 230.829,
      "end": 232.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every place shall be,",
      "verse": "17:23",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 232.588,
      "end": 236.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "where there were a thousand vines at a thousand silverlings,",
      "verse": "17:23",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 237.04,
      "end": 239.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall be for briers and thorns.",
      "verse": "17:23",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 240.088,
      "end": 242.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "With arrows and with bows",
      "verse": "17:24",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 242.218,
      "end": 243.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall men come thither,",
      "verse": "17:24",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 244.023,
      "end": 247.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because all the land shall become briers and thorns.",
      "verse": "17:24",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 247.722,
      "end": 250.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all hills that shall be digged with the mattock,",
      "verse": "17:25",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 251.153,
      "end": 254.775,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there shall not come thither the fear of briers and thorns;",
      "verse": "17:25",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 254.955,
      "end": 257.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but it shall be for the sending forth of oxen,",
      "verse": "17:25",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 258.107,
      "end": 260.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the treading of lesser cattle.",
      "verse": "17:25",
      "lineIndex": 87
    }
  ]
}